'''Hangar two-nine''' was a [[hangar]] bay that was located on the [[MC80 Star Cruiser]] ''[[Home One]]''. During the [[New Republic Era]], the [[shuttle]] [[T-6 1974|''T-6'' 1974]], [[Pilot|piloted]] by the [[Togruta]] [[Ahsoka Tano]], was given approval by an [[officer]] within [[Fleet Command (New Republic)|New Republic Fleet Command]] to dock within the hangar.<ref name="Part One" />

